title: $:/themes/tiddlywiki/quietude/settings
tags: [[$:/tags/Stylesheet]]

\rules only filteredtranscludeinline transcludeinline macrodef macrocallinline

/*
** Reading width. The ControlPanel field re-points the measure token, which the
** body, the title block, the subtitle, the tags row and the info panel all
** follow. No `!important` is needed: this stylesheet loads after variables.tid
** (pinned first by its `list-before` field), so a plain re-declaration on the
** same :root wins on order. The `~[[40rem]]` tail keeps the default when the
** config tiddler is absent or empty.
*/

:root{--q-measure:{{{ [[$:/config/themes/quietude/measure]get[text]] ~[[40rem]] }}};}
